<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-18T18:45:10.659Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:45:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent attacks show a surge in both jihadist and bandit violence across Nigeria and neighboring Sahel states. Terrorists killed soldiers at a Borno military post, killed eight soldiers near the Cameroon border with a landmine, and killed two officers in an Abia police station attack, while bandits killed one civilian and abducted three in Niger State. Rival jihadist groups JNIM and IS-linked factions clashed in northwestern Nigeria and Burkina Faso, with IS claiming over 400 JNIM fighters killed. The United States added Nigeria to its blacklist for recruiting child soldiers, and Mali expanded its reserve force by 2,400 recruits, including 800 women. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTFAxd1h0M2NOM0lTQzNjbENoRTNKQkFhYzEzbjhEVnFEVkRaeVdpQURjaGlQeHkyNlRJNDk4XzZHeW1aMHFIbWd4RmpzTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQekJZS0Nab2NieDNYRjhYdU1xQXduZ1pwUGREVjdKZl96eWV1TGdrSEJPOUJVODlZdnpmVUJ4eVNFZXpxZk5zY1dESlUxWDVZSnNueXVsTVFRY0V0djFRSEtibDMyOURzT3FUaFV6ekUzejVuQVJMR2VlRGh2THZWUUI5cEtvdnZUYzg0Qm8ycUctMGVHVWo1QnRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOS1BOUDFSM3laZnVTQ3RYTjh2NmlkZ3Q1Mk10Y19pRDdwRm1QVVoxNlpNenBkVW9IVGxKbk9hMUZqUWR4QVVxamZINnZ1X1pGcFBVZmJDTjNXR21YaUp2WTJoYW80ay1GT2RsUEJPOVVESFk3aGRiSWdWc1g3VWlDQlBUaWVLRloxS053WjdpYzNyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit.ng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPNGZscE5NaEtLMEdLLXZ1RmVHd3FFVmd1UVAtd0JwWUtnYmpvdTFfSWxTUVJHbFRrZHlPRWRJZnI2Nzhsa3FaVnRYZlRPV2l5S1psbHFDTW4wMVJmT0RRRFNLU295SDVjZDBuZjdhMzZYNUQ4bGotWmVhaTZsREptSHBwR2hwTGNza2cwbUVVVmFSUjJ1aWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lawfare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt